      "content": "been reading a lot of schopenhauer lately for a seminar and honestly it's kind of messing with me. like the idea that existence is fundamentally characterized by suffering and that pleasure is just the temporary absence of pain... i keep finding myself thinking \"yeah, that tracks.\" not just as an abstract claim but like. when i actually look at my own life\n\ndo you think he's right? that the bad outweighs the good in most human lives?",
